{"id":"a2e7cac8985289f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-symbolic-dynamics.md","title":"Symbolic Dynamics","display":"df-symbolic-dynamics — Symbolic Dynamics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-symbolic-dynamics","aliases":["58-df-symbolic-dynamics"],"display":"df-symbolic-dynamics — Symbolic Dynamics","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-symbolic-dynamics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-symbolic-dynamics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symbolic-dynamics — Symbolic Dynamics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma\\in V\">\\(A,\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullShift}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FullShift}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subshift}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subshift}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}shift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FullShift}_S(A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\land\\exists\\vec A,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\mathbb Z,\\{A\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb Z,\\{\\mathcal P(A)\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\mathbb Z,\\vec A,\\vec\\tau,A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,A^{\\mathbb Z},A^{\\mathbb Z})\n\\land\\forall x\\in A^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\sigma(x)(n)=x(n+1)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}shift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FullShift}_S(A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\land\\exists\\vec A,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\mathbb Z,\\{A\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb Z,\\{\\mathcal P(A)\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\mathbb Z,\\vec A,\\vec\\tau,A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,A^{\\mathbb Z},A^{\\mathbb Z})\n\\land\\forall x\\in A^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\sigma(x)(n)=x(n+1)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subshift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subshift}_S(X,A,\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FullShift}_S(A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma,A)\n\\land X\\subseteq A^{\\mathbb Z}\n\\land A^{\\mathbb Z}\\setminus X\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}}\n\\land\\sigma[X]=X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subshift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subshift}_S(X,A,\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FullShift}_S(A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma,A)\n\\land X\\subseteq A^{\\mathbb Z}\n\\land A^{\\mathbb Z}\\setminus X\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}}\n\\land\\sigma[X]=X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closedness is expanded as openness of the complement in the explicitly constructed product topology.</li>\n<li>For a two-sided full shift, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> is a homeomorphism, so equality is the standard invariance condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullShift}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subshift}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}shift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FullShift}_S(A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\land\\exists\\vec A,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\mathbb Z,\\{A\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb Z,\\{\\mathcal P(A)\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\mathbb Z,\\vec A,\\vec\\tau,A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,A^{\\mathbb Z},A^{\\mathbb Z})\n\\land\\forall x\\in A^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\sigma(x)(n)=x(n+1)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subshift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subshift}_S(X,A,\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FullShift}_S(A^{\\mathbb Z},\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}},\\sigma,A)\n\\land X\\subseteq A^{\\mathbb Z}\n\\land A^{\\mathbb Z}\\setminus X\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{prod}}\n\\land\\sigma[X]=X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1887,"backlinks":[{"id":"8306a79d3c8e988a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-symbolic-dynamics.md|58-df-symbolic-dynamics]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["5260a5349d0b732f","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}